  "releaseNotes": "2.2\n- Maintenance updates\n- Replace Newtonsoft.Json with System.Text.Json\n- Change WeatherInfo.CityId from string to int\n- Mark GetWeatherOneCallAsync and GetWeatherOneCallHistoricAsync as obsolete (One Call API 2.5 was retired by OpenWeatherMap)\n\n2.1\n- Extended the 16-day forecast model (DailyWeatherForecastItem) with missing properties\n\n2.0\n- Use unit types from dependency UnitsNet\n\n1.2\n- Major refactoring in wind direction data model\n- Add multilingual support\n\n1.0\n- Initial release",
